Z||000003||batboy||04-04-2000||08:52 PM||||I have one of those battery boxes and have the relocation project "almost" finished. Here is other boxes for sale too.<P> <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/tray.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/tray.htm</A> <P><BR>As Ogre has pointed out, you must be very careful with those aluminum boxes, if it ever shorts out, it could mean big trouble. The fiberglass ones are much cheaper, less than half the price too. Here is the topic I started when I was working on my battery project. Lots of pics, it'll take a few seconds to load.<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/002567.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/002567.html</A><p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 04-04-2000).]||||reg||1
